{
  "sn44.7:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 44.7 ",
  "sn44.7:0.2": "1. Abyākatavagga ",
  "sn44.7:0.3": "Moggallānasutta ",
  "sn44.7:1.1": "Atha kho vacchagotto paribbājako yenāyasmā mahāmoggallāno tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā āyasmatā mahāmoggallānena saddhiṁ sammodi. ",
  "sn44.7:1.2": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho vacchagotto paribbājako āyasmantaṁ mahāmoggallānaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn44.7:2.1": "“Kiṁ nu kho, bho moggallāna, sassato loko”ti? ",
  "sn44.7:2.2": "“Abyākataṁ kho etaṁ, vaccha, bhagavatā: ",
  "sn44.7:2.3": "‘sassato loko’”ti. ",
  "sn44.7:2.4": "“Kiṁ pana, bho moggallāna, asassato loko”ti? ",
  "sn44.7:2.5": "“Etampi kho, vaccha, abyākataṁ bhagavatā: ",
  "sn44.7:2.6": "‘asassato loko’”ti. ",
  "sn44.7:2.7": "“Kiṁ nu kho, bho moggallāna, antavā loko”ti? ",
  "sn44.7:2.8": "“Abyākataṁ kho etaṁ, vaccha, bhagavatā: ",
  "sn44.7:2.9": "‘antavā loko’”ti. ",
  "sn44.7:2.10": "“Kiṁ pana, bho moggallāna, anantavā loko”ti? ",
  "sn44.7:2.11": "“Etampi kho, vaccha, abyākataṁ bhagavatā: ",
  "sn44.7:2.12": "‘anantavā loko’”ti. ",
  "sn44.7:2.13": "“Kiṁ nu kho, bho moggallāna, taṁ jīvaṁ taṁ sarīran”ti? ",
  "sn44.7:2.14": "“Abyākataṁ kho etaṁ, vaccha, bhagavatā: ",
  "sn44.7:2.15": "‘taṁ jīvaṁ taṁ sarīran’”ti. ",
  "sn44.7:2.16": "“Kiṁ pana, bho moggallāna, aññaṁ jīvaṁ aññaṁ sarīra